BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4-2-2025 Omaha DSA Membership & Outreach Working Group Called Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20250402T180000
DESCRIPTION: Join us as we go over our onboarding process.
    
        Agenda (tentative):
    
    Call meeting to order
        Introductions
