BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Monthly Board Games at Spielbound
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260417T170000
DESCRIPTION: Monthly board game meetup at Spielbound! Come play board games with fellow members. Drop in and drop out is fine as your schedule permits! RSVP not necessary, this is an informal meetup. Cover cost is $7 and food and drink are available for purchase. If you need assistance with transportation or the cover cost, please let Colin know in the DSA discord or use the message event creator options on this event!For those who are so inclined, after this event another comrade is playing with their band very nearby to Spielbound at Coven at 9pm, for those who are interested in that as well. Carpooling can be arranged from Spielbound.  \n ID: [ 64435d52-efe9-40b4-9ffe-aaf8f690a174 ] \n LINK: [ https://actionnetwork.org/events/monthly-board-games-at-spielbound-2 ].
