BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2025 Omaha DSA Chapter Convention
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20250621T123000
DESCRIPTION: Join us for the first annual Omaha DSA Chapter Convention! All members in good standing are welcome to attend. Help determine the priorities and direction of Omaha DSA for the coming year, and elect the new Steering Committee for 2025-26. Non-members may also RSVP, but will not be eligible to vote on action items.This meeting will double as the chapter's General Meeting for June, there will not be a separate general meeting this month.Omaha DSA members in good standing as of June 14, 2025 will be automatically registered for voting at the event, but we ask that anyone wishing to attend RSVP here. If you are not a DSA member, join us! \n ID: [ 4a3fe254-be44-4196-84cd-073740a90bc2 ] \n LINK: [ https://actionnetwork.org/events/2025-omaha-dsa-chapter-convention ].
