SUMMARY:11-26-2025 Stop Buying Starbucks @ 114th & West Dodge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20251126T170000
DESCRIPTION: 
	If Starbucks won’t move on a fair contract and quit its union 
busting campaign, baristas are ready to strike right on the company's busiest sales day of the year. The
